# Factions architecture (pointer)

Full law: [`docs/docs/architecture/factions.md`](../../docs/docs/architecture/factions.md).

**Permanent decision:** **Factions** are **NPC / world** groups (joinable
guilds, standing-only, aggro-sides). Players join / earn **faction XP → rank →
skill line**. Standing ≠ ARC ≠ AC. Catalog defs; durable membership + standing.
**Not** player crews — those are [Organizations](../../docs/docs/architecture/organizations.md).
[Missions](../../docs/docs/architecture/missions.md),
[NPCs](../../docs/docs/architecture/npc.md),
[Mobs](../../docs/docs/architecture/mobs.md),
[Home Worlds](../../docs/docs/architecture/home-worlds.md).

When changing faction defs, join/rank/skill lines, standing deltas, or aggro
sides, read the full doc first. Also listed in `AGENTS.md`.
